  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0: Built-in diagnostic logging via Microsoft.Extensions.Logging. Add services.AddCacheLogging() to automatically wire logging from your DI container — zero manual configuration. All key cache operations (Get, Remove, RemoveGroup, RemoveAll, background refresh) now emit Debug-level log messages. Use Serilog namespace overrides to control verbosity per environment.",
